{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56362","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 千里蒸蒸二章（十句） · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 千里蒸蒸二章（十句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）教里闾勃兴远是効敦□崇德（下缺）心因，慕之慎□。\n□纪敦淡，黎庶咸归。\n（下缺）公之（下缺）（按：此诗二章，因残泐已无从分析，姑连录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}